## media (extension)

Syntax: ![alt](adf:media/UUID?collection=&width=&height=&layout=&size=)

```markdown
![shot.png](adf:media/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555?collection=contentId-123456&width=1512&height=945&layout=wide&size=720px)
```

```json
{
  "type": "doc",
  "version": 1,
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "mediaSingle",
      "attrs": {
        "layout": "wide",
        "width": 720,
        "widthType": "pixel"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "media",
          "attrs": {
            "type": "file",
            "id": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
            "collection": "contentId-123456",
            "alt": "shot.png",
            "width": 1512,
            "height": 945
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
